{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtStandardBasisCore","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtDominanceCore","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Sort","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Monotone.Basic"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_triangular'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_triangular'","kind":"theorem","line":400,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L400-L413","doc":"**Reassembled brick-4 bundle.** A verbatim restatement of\n`SpechtStandardBasis.standardPolytabloid_triangular`, proved sorry-free modulo\n**the single** isolated dominance core `standardPolytabloid_dominance_order`\n(the order + `supp_le` field). The other two fields are fully sorry-free here:\n`diag_unit` (`standardPolytabloid_diag_unit`) and `lead_inj`\n(`leadTab_injective`, whose leading-tabloid-determines-SYT core\n`leadTab_injective_core` is fully proved above). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_dominance_order","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_dominance_order","kind":"theorem","line":384,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L384-L395","doc":"**The dominance core, discharged by reduction.** Proved **sorry-free modulo**\nthe deeper relation-level core `SpechtDominanceCore.dominance_relation_exists`: the\n`SpechtDominanceCore` reduction peels off the `LinearOrder` construction (a\nSzpilrajn-for-Fintypes lever) and the `Finsupp`/`support` plumbing, leaving only\nSagan's dominance lemma (`DominanceData`: a partial order on tabloids under which\ncolumn permutations weakly decrease, plus antisymmetry). This consumes its verbatim\nrestatement `standardPolytabloid_dominance_order'`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.leadTab_injective","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.leadTab_injective","kind":"theorem","line":374,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L374-L379","doc":"The `lead_inj` field: `leadTab` is injective on standard Young tableaux —\n**fully sorry-free** (the row-pattern decoding `leadTab_eq_iff` plus the\nleading-tabloid-determines-SYT core `leadTab_injective_core`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.leadTab_injective_core","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.leadTab_injective_core","kind":"theorem","line":342,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L342-L371","doc":"**Leading tabloid ⇒ SYT determined (fully proved, sorry-free).** Two standard\nYoung tableaux whose underlying fillings have the *same row pattern* (each label\noccupies the same row in both) are equal. Off-diagram entries agree by\n`zero_off`; on-diagram, within each row both entry functions are the unique\nstrict-monotone enumeration (`entry_eq_orderEmbOfFin`) of the row's value set,\nand those value sets agree (`rowSet_eq_of_rowPattern_eq`), so the entries agree. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.entry_eq_orderEmbOfFin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.entry_eq_orderEmbOfFin","kind":"theorem","line":330,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L330-L340","doc":"The entry function on row `i` **is** the unique order-embedding of `rowSet T i`\ninto `ℕ` (sorry-free): it is strict-mono into `rowSet`, so by\n`Finset.orderEmbOfFin_unique` it equals `(rowSet T i).orderEmbOfFin`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.rowSet_card","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.rowSet_card","kind":"theorem","line":313,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L313-L328","doc":"`#(rowSet T i) = rowLen i` (sorry-free): the entry map is injective on the\nrow's column range (strict-mono), so the image has full cardinality. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.rowSet_eq_of_rowPattern_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.rowSet_eq_of_rowPattern_eq","kind":"theorem","line":294,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L294-L311","doc":"Equal row patterns ⇒ equal per-row value sets (sorry-free): the bridge\n`mem_rowSet_iff` plus pointwise equality of `rowPattern`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.mem_rowSet_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.mem_rowSet_iff","kind":"theorem","line":264,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L264-L292","doc":"**Value↔row bridge.** A value `v` lies in `rowSet T i` iff `v` is a valid\nlabel whose cell (under `sytToTableau T`) sits in row `i`. This connects the\nentry-indexed `rowSet` to the label-indexed `rowPattern` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.entry_fin_strictMono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.entry_fin_strictMono","kind":"theorem","line":254,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L254-L262","doc":"The row-indexed entry map `Fin (rowLen i) → ℕ`, `j ↦ T.entry i j`, is strictly\nmonotone (sorry-free, from `entry_row_strictMonoOn`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.rowSet","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.rowSet","kind":"def","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L250-L252","doc":"The **per-row value set** of `T` at row `i`: `{T.entry i j : j < rowLen i}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.entry_row_strictMonoOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.entry_row_strictMonoOn","kind":"theorem","line":223,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L223-L248","doc":"**Row-monotonicity upgrade.** The consecutive-step `row_strict` upgrades to a\nstrict-monotonicity statement on a whole row: for cells `(i,j),(i,j') ∈ μ` with\n`j < j'`, `T.entry i j < T.entry i j'`. Induction on the gap (cells in a row are\ndownward-closed in the column index, `YoungDiagram.mem_iff_lt_rowLen`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.leadTab_eq_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.leadTab_eq_iff","kind":"theorem","line":216,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L216-L221","doc":"`leadTab T₁ = leadTab T₂` decodes to equality of row patterns of the\nunderlying fillings (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.sytToTableau_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.sytToTableau_mem","kind":"theorem","line":211,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L211-L214","doc":"The cell `sytToTableau T l` is a genuine cell of `μ` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.sytToTableau_cellLabel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.sytToTableau_cellLabel","kind":"theorem","line":204,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L204-L209","doc":"The cell with `T`-entry `cellLabel T c` is `c` itself: `sytToTableau` inverts\n`cellLabel` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.entry_sytToTableau","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.entry_sytToTableau","kind":"theorem","line":191,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L191-L202","doc":"The cell that `sytToTableau T` assigns to a label carries `T`-entry equal to\nthat label: `T.entry (sytToTableau T l).1.1 (sytToTableau T l).1.2 = l`. This\ninverts `cellLabel` (sorry-free). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_diag_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_diag_unit","kind":"theorem","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L173-L177","doc":"The `diag_unit` field: `(standardPolytabloid T)(leadTab T)` is a unit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_diag_coeff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.standardPolytabloid_diag_coeff","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L115-L170","doc":"**The diagonal coefficient is `1`.** The coefficient of the leading tabloid\n`{T}` in the standard polytabloid `e_T` is `1`:\n`(standardPolytabloid T)(leadTab T) = 1`. The sum over `C_t` collapses to its\nidentity term by `colStab_inf_rowStab_eq_one`: a column permutation contributes\nto the `{t}`-coefficient iff `{π • t} = {t}` iff `π ∈ R_t`, which together with\n`π ∈ C_t` forces `π = 1`, whose sign is `+1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.colStab_inf_rowStab_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.SpechtTriangularCore.colStab_inf_rowStab_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/SpechtTriangularCore.lean#L83-L110","doc":"**`C_t ∩ R_t = {1}`.** If `π : Perm (Fin (nOf μ))` stabilizes both the\ncolumn pattern and the row pattern of a bijective tableau `t`, then `π = 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}